San Diegans deserve beaches free from sewage and air free from toxic gasses.

@SenAlexPadilla and I are calling for emergency funds to help us fix the broken wastewater treatment plant, which will be instrumental in ending this crisis. 

Thank you to @Senlaphonza, @RepJuanVargas, @RepSaraJacobs, @RepMikeLevin, and seven other members of Congress for joining us.
